{"type":"text","timestamp":1768792764069,"sessionID":"ses_42bbc67dfffevhg3Sgc65Fimag","part":{"id":"prt_bd443abf1001XCZJpCRA77pFVl","sessionID":"ses_42bbc67dfffevhg3Sgc65Fimag","messageID":"msg_bd4439854001LGrsgWta95BkpS","type":"text","text":"I'll implement the Game Results View. Let me first explore the existing codebase to understand the structure.","time":{"start":1768792764068,"end":1768792764068}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1768792858724,"sessionID":"ses_42bbc67dfffevhg3Sgc65Fimag","part":{"id":"prt_bd443aea40019F6RDnfZAkvoGc","sessionID":"ses_42bbc67dfffevhg3Sgc65Fimag","messageID":"msg_bd4439854001LGrsgWta95BkpS","type":"tool","callID":"call_function_o9i58jjo4je7_1","tool":"task","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"description":"Explore game structure","prompt":"Explore the codebase to understand:\n1. The structure of game components in components/game/\n2. How Convex stores game state (players, rounds, games)\n3. How the lobby works and returns to lobby\n4. Existing component patterns and styling\n\nLook at:\n- components/game/ directory\n- convex/schema.ts for data structures\n- existing game components for patterns\n- messages/en.json for translation keys\n\nReturn:\n- List of existing game components\n- Data structure for players and rounds\n- How to navigate back to lobby\n- Translation key patterns for game-related text","subagent_type":"explore"},"output":"## Codebase Exploration Summary\n\n### 1. Existing Game Components (`src/components/game/`)\n\n| Component | File | Purpose |\n|-----------|------|---------|\n| `GameView` | `GameView.tsx` | Main game container, orchestrates all game UI |\n| `GameHeader` | `GameHeader.tsx` | Shows round number, current turn player, timer |\n| `CurrentRoundPanel` | `CurrentRoundPanel.tsx` | Phase-aware panel (placing/betting/resolved) |\n| `TimelinePlacer` | `TimelinePlacer.tsx` | Turn player places song on their timeline |\n| `BettingPanel` | `BettingPanel.tsx` | Other players bet on song position |\n| `PlayersBar` | `PlayersBar.tsx` | Horizontal player list with coins/timeline size |\n| `MyTimeline` | `MyTimeline.tsx` | Shows current player's collected cards |\n| `RoundResults` | `RoundResults.tsx` | Displays round resolution and awards |\n| `SoftTimer` | `SoftTimer.tsx` | Countdown timer with visual feedback |\n| `PresenceIndicator` | `PresenceIndicator.tsx` | Online status dot with pulse animation |\n\n---\n\n### 2. Data Structures (Convex Schema)\n\n#### Players Table\n```typescript\nplayers: {\n  lobbyId: Id<\"lobbies\">;\n  sessionId: string;\n  displayName: string;\n  isHost: boolean;\n  coins: number;\n  timeline: TimelineEntry[];\n  timelineSize: number;\n  createdAt: number;\n}\n\nTimelineEntry: {\n  trackId: Id<\"tracks\">;\n  year: number;\n  earnedAtRoundNumber: number;\n  earnedBy: \"placement\" | \"bet\";\n}\n```\n\n#### Rounds Table\n```typescript\nrounds: {\n  gameId: Id<\"games\">;\n  roundNumber: number;\n  turnPlayerId: Id<\"players\">;\n  trackId: Id<\"tracks\">;\n  phase: \"placing\" | \"betting\" | \"resolved\";\n  startedAt: number;\n  placementPreview?: { proposedIndex: number; updatedAt: number };\n  placement?: { proposedIndex: number; submittedAt: number };\n  resolution?: {\n    validIndexMin: number;\n    validIndexMax: number;\n    turnPlayerWasCorrect: boolean;\n    awardedPlayerIds: Id<\"players\">[];\n    coinDeltas: { playerId: Id<\"players\">; delta: number }[];\n    resolvedAt: number;\n  };\n}\n```\n\n#### Games Table\n```typescript\ngames: {\n  lobbyId: Id<\"lobbies\">;\n  status: \"active\" | \"paused\" | \"finished\";\n  startedAt: number;\n  endedAt?: number;\n  currentRoundNumber: number;\n  currentRoundId?: Id<\"rounds\">;\n  turnPlayerId?: Id<\"players\">;\n  turnOrder: Id<\"players\">[];\n  winnerPlayerId?: Id<\"players\">;\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n### 3. Returning to Lobby\n\nThe `LobbyPageContent` component (`src/app/lobby/[code]/LobbyPageContent.tsx`) handles the navigation:\n\n**In-Game Lobby View (lines 192-208):**\n```tsx\n{isInGame ? (\n  <GameView lobbyId={lobby._id} code={code} />\n) : (\n  // Pre-game lobby UI with PlayerList, StartGameButton, SettingsPanel\n)}\n```\n\n**How it works:**\n- The page uses `lobby.status` to determine if game is in progress (`\"in_game\"`)\n- When `status === \"in_game\"`, it renders `<GameView />`\n- When `status === \"lobby\"`, it renders pre-game lobby UI\n- No explicit \"back to lobby\" button exists in game view currently\n- Lobby code is preserved in URL: `/lobby/[code]`\n\n**Leave Lobby Functionality (lines 69-79):**\n```tsx\nconst handleLeaveLobby = async () => {\n  await leaveLobby({ code, sessionId });\n  router.push(\"/\");  // Navigates to home\n};\n```\n\n---\n\n### 4. Component Patterns & Styling\n\n#### Import Order (from AGENTS.md)\n```typescript\n// External packages first, then internal, then relative\nimport { useQuery } from \"convex/react\";\nimport { api } from \"@/convex/_generated/api\";\nimport { Button } from \"@/components/ui/button\";\nimport { GameHeader } from \"./GameHeader\";\n```\n\n#### Tailwind CSS Pattern\n```tsx\n// Card with conditional styling\n<div className={`\n  flex items-center gap-3 p-3 rounded-lg border transition-all\n  ${isHighlighted ? \"ring-2 ring-primary\" : \"\"}\n  ${isCurrentUser ? \"border-primary/50\" : \"\"}\n`}>\n```\n\n#### UI Components Used\n- `Button` - Primary actions\n- `Progress` - Timer visualization\n- `sonner` - Toast notifications\n- `lucide-react` - Icons\n\n#### Phase-Based Rendering (CurrentRoundPanel)\n```tsx\nswitch (phase) {\n  case \"placing\":\n    return <TimelinePlacer />;\n  case \"betting\":\n    return <BettingPanel />;\n  case \"resolved\":\n    return <RoundResults />;\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n### 5. Translation Keys Pattern\n\n**Note:** The `messages/` directory does not exist yet. Based on the AGENTS.md spec, i18n should use `next-intl` with namespace-based keys:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"common\": {\n    \"loading\": \"Loading...\",\n    \"error\": \"An error occurred\"\n  },\n  \"lobby\": {\n    \"title\": \"Game Lobby\",\n    \"joinCode\": \"Join Code\",\n    \"startGame\": \"Start Game\"\n  },\n  \"game\": {\n    \"round\": \"Round {number}\",\n    \"yourTurn\": \"Your Turn\",\n    \"placeSong\": \"Place this song on your timeline\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**Current hardcoded strings in components:**\n- `\"Loading game...\"` / `\"Loading game state...\"`\n- `\"Your Turn\"` / `\"{player}'s Turn\"`\n- `\"Place the song on your timeline\"` / `\"Player is placing the song...\"`\n- `\"Place Your Bet\"` / `\"Where should the song go on the timeline?\"`\n- `\"Round Results\"` / `\"The song has been revealed...\"`\n- `\"Placement Correct!\"` / `\"Placement Incorrect\"`\n\nThese should eventually be replaced with `useTranslations(\"game\")` calls.\n\n<task_metadata>\nsession_id: ses_42bbc4a7affefwVJK3X530trSF\n</task_metadata>","title":"Explore game structure","metadata":{"summary":[{"id":"prt_bd443c1d3001QBhECT06z81wHY","tool":"glob","state":{"status":"completed","title":""}},{"id":"prt_bd443c3b8001KwydwjPm0KM5q5","tool":"read","state":{"status":"completed","title":"convex/schema.ts"}},{"id":"prt_bd443c48c00104LkslHA5pa3Ob","tool":"read","state":{"status":"error"}},{"id":"prt_bd443cfd5001YXlOQ2M43vao2I","tool":"bash","state":{"status":"completed","title":"List components directory"}},{"id":"prt_bd443d3a3001dOR4HtUHDeAEqI","tool":"bash","state":{"status":"completed","title":"List root directory"}},{"id":"prt_bd443d509001nbnwLMEIAPYfWy","tool":"glob","state":{"status":"completed","title":""}},{"id":"prt_bd443e9c7001diCBCzKasO9SZl","tool":"bash","state":{"status":"completed","title":"List src directory"}},{"id":"prt_bd443eaff001al6Pe2ZMySD2nH","tool":"glob","state":{"status":"completed","title":""}},{"id":"prt_bd443f6280013ui5UQY3W2gRpo","tool":"read","state":{"status":"completed","title":"src/components/game/GameView.tsx"}},{"id":"prt_bd443f7ae001DkKa2atGWXfDg4","tool":"read","state":{"status":"completed","title":"src/components/game/GameHeader.tsx"}},{"id":"prt_bd443f8ed0010iwOyE6mlAMSft","tool":"read","state":{"status":"completed","title":"src/components/game/CurrentRoundPanel.tsx"}},{"id":"prt_bd443fa290013JYYwAEipAn9me","tool":"read","state":{"status":"completed","title":"src/app/lobby/[code]/LobbyPageContent.tsx"}},{"id":"prt_bd443fbc8001X9aai5hTc5EcZI","tool":"bash","state":{"status":"completed","title":"List app directory"}},{"id":"prt_bd444103d00